{
 "id": "zenodo:10600167",
 "title": "GWAS Summary Statistics from \"Sex and statin-related genetic associations at the PCSK9 gene locus – results of genome-wide association meta-analysis\"",
 "url": "https://zenodo.org/records/10600167",
 "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.10600167",
 "description": "<p>GWAMA summary statistics of PCSK9 levels stratified by sex and statin useage in Europeans.</p>\n<p>When using this data, please cite:</p>\n<p>Pott, J., Kheirkhah, A., Gadin, J.R.&nbsp;<em>et al.</em> Sex and statin-related genetic associations at the <em>PCSK9</em> gene locus: results of genome-wide association meta-analysis. <em>Biol Sex Differ</em> <strong>15</strong>, 26 (2024). https://doi.org/10.1186/s13293-024-00602-6</p>\n<p>All txt files contain the following columns:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>markername (unique SNP ID)</li>\n<li>chr</li>\n<li>bp_hg19 (base position according to hg19)</li>\n<li>EA (effect allele)</li>\n<li>OA (other allele)</li>\n<li>EAF (effect allele frequency)</li>\n<li>info (minimal info score across all used studies)</li>\n<li>nSamples (sample size per SNP)</li>\n<li>nStudies (in case of double-stratified data: number of studies; in case of single-stratified data: 2, as it is a meta-analysis of the two double-stratified data sets)</li>\n<li>beta (effect estimate)</li>\n<li>SE (standard error)</li>\n<li>pval (p-value)</li>\n<li>I2 (SNP heterogeneity across studies)</li>\n<li>invalidAssoc (TRUE/FALSE flag if this variant was excluded in our analysis)</li>\n<li>reason4exclusion (reason why this SNP was excluded)</li>\n<li>phenotype (phenotyp setting)</li>\n</ul>",
 "found_by_keywords": [
